# Bitcoin Lab's quad world's bindings for `coax wgsl apps/openagents-web/gpu/bitcoin-lab-fx.coax`
# (coax/web/wgsl-module.coax): NAME GROUP BINDING, and `uniform COUNT` for a []f32 read as a
# uniform block of COUNT vec4fs. They are coax/web/host.js's particlePipeline layouts: group 0
# charactercreator.wgsl's uniforms, read up to the camera's up (32 floats, 8 vec4fs); group 1 the quads (named puffs: the hosts hand the particle buffer to that name).
u 0 0 uniform 8
puffs 1 0
